              "date": "2026-11-27T14:24:10Z"
            }
          ],
          "series_items": [],
          "patch_summary": "This patch addresses an issue where dirty swapin folios are not properly cleaned up, leading to increased exit times and performance degradation in certain workloads. The problem arises when a folio is dirtied but its swap cache slot remains reserved until the folio is reclaimed or its owner exits. To fix this, the patch modifies the do_swap_page function to free the swap cache of dirty folios as well, which reduces the number of folios left in the swap cache and improves performance. The change has been tested on a production workload and a microbenchmark, showing significant improvements in exit times and throughput.",
